            "text": "const SECRET_PATH_RE = /(^|[/\\\\])(\\.ssh|\\.gnupg|\\.aws|\\.azure|\\.config[/\\\\]gcloud|\\.kube|1password|op-vault|password-store)([/\\\\]|$)/i;"
